    "readme_description": "Given an array intervals where intervals[i] = [li, ri] represent the interval [li, ri), remove all intervals that are covered by another interval in the list.\n\n- The interval [a, b) is covered by the interval [c, d) if and only if c <= a and b <= d.\n\nReturn the number of remaining intervals.",
